WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
But please Madam Fang, fight to the death

2
00:00:04,610 --> 00:00:06,610
I said, did you fail to pay the electricity bill?

3
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:08,410
How is it possible

4
00:00:08,410 --> 00:00:10,410
Why is your thunderbolt green?

5
00:00:10,410 --> 00:00:11,410
Westerners are just so environmentally friendly.

6
00:00:11,410 --> 00:00:14,410
If you want to live a good life, you must always have a little green on your head

7
00:00:14,410 --> 00:00:16,410
Brother Peijia, when you showed off your thunder?

8
00:00:16,410 --> 00:00:17,410
Are you still touching it to be part of the show?

9
00:00:17,410 --> 00:00:19,410
Normal people, who plays green?

10
00:00:19,410 --> 00:00:21,410
Brother Peijia, does your wife know that you are on a business trip?

11
00:00:21,410 --> 00:00:24,410
Tiezi, did you drop the marriage-killing mine?

12
00:00:24,410 --> 00:00:25,410
Stir the food for me

13
00:00:25,410 --> 00:00:27,410
If you help me fight ten more times, I will disturb you.

14
00:00:27,410 --> 00:00:29,410
Bastard, despicable and ignorant

15
00:00:29,410 --> 00:00:32,410
He actually took me out to hold my tears

16
00:00:32,410 --> 00:00:46,280
The four great generals except Chu Mangren

17
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:48,280
Each of the three of you counts as one

18
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:49,280
Can last ten minutes in my hand
